6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm looking at timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, plus the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall review the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll check the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
